(Scanner Generalization for Mitosis Detection in MIDOG++) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Prepared for the AI for Health project demo.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Project Goal) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The goal of this project is to study whether a mitotic figure detection model can generalize) Tj
T*
(across scanner types in real digital pathology images. This matters because pathology models) Tj
T*
(may perform well on images from one scanner but degrade when tested on images from another) Tj
T*
(scanner due to differences in color, stain appearance, contrast, sharpness, and image) Tj
T*
(acquisition.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The working research question is:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Can stain/color augmentation improve scanner generalization for mitotic figure detection on) Tj
T*
(MIDOG++ breast cancer pathology images?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Dataset Prepared) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We prepared a breast cancer subset from the MIDOG++ data. The subset includes pathology) Tj
T*
(image files and metadata/labels needed by teammates:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(* Images: breast_cancer_subset/images/) Tj
T*
(* Slide metadata: breast_cancer_subset/metadata/breast_cancer_slides.csv) Tj
T*
(* Annotation JSON: breast_cancer_subset/metadata/annotations_breast_cancer.json) Tj
T*
(* Category file: breast_cancer_subset/metadata/categories.csv) Tj
T*
(* Annotation counts: breast_cancer_subset/metadata/annotation_counts_by_image.csv) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The labels include mitotic figures and non-mitotic candidates. For detection training, the) Tj
T*
(mitotic annotations were used as bounding boxes. Bounding boxes are represented in image) Tj
T*
(coordinates.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Important scanner groups used in the experiments:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(* Aperio CS2) Tj
T*
(* Hamamatsu S360) Tj
T*
(* Hamammatsu XR) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Experimental Setup) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We used a leave-one-scanner-out setup, abbreviated as LOSO. In LOSO, one scanner is held out) Tj
T*
(for testing while the model trains on the other scanners. This directly tests scanner) Tj
T*
(generalization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Example:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F1 8 Tf
(Page 1 of 5) Tj
ET
