(* Train on Hamamatsu S360 + Hamammatsu XR, test on Aperio CS2.) Tj
T*
(* Train on Aperio CS2 + Hamammatsu XR, test on Hamamatsu S360.) Tj
T*
(* Train on Aperio CS2 + Hamamatsu S360, test on Hamammatsu XR.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This setup is more meaningful than a random split for this project because a random split) Tj
T*
(may place images from the same scanner in both training and testing, which can overestimate) Tj
T*
(generalization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Patch-Level Baseline) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Before training a full detector, we built a patch classification baseline. This used cropped) Tj
T*
(patches around candidate regions and tested whether the model could classify mitotic vs non-) Tj
T*
(mitotic regions across held-out scanner types.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Two patch models were compared:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(* Pixel baseline: a small image-based classifier without color augmentation.) Tj
T*
(* Pixel augmented: the same general approach with stain/color augmentation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Patch-level LOSO results:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Held-out scanner | Pixel F1 | Augmented F1 | Delta F1 | Pixel Recall | Augmented Recall) Tj
T*
(Aperio CS2 | 0.412 | 0.450 | +0.038 | 0.384 | 0.440) Tj
T*
(Hamamatsu S360 | 0.346 | 0.413 | +0.068 | 0.345 | 0.466) Tj
T*
(Hamammatsu XR | 0.529 | 0.525 | -0.004 | 0.794 | 0.785) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Mean patch-level results:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Model | Mean F1 | Mean Precision | Mean Recall | Mean Accuracy) Tj
T*
(Pixel baseline | 0.429 | 0.395 | 0.508 | 0.509) Tj
T*
(Pixel augmented | 0.463 | 0.409 | 0.564 | 0.510) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Interpretation:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Color augmentation improved mean held-out F1 from 0.429 to 0.463 and mean recall from 0.508) Tj
T*
(to 0.564. This supported the idea that stain/color variation may help scanner) Tj
T*
(generalization, but this was still only a patch-level result.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Full Detection Dataset) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(To move closer to real pathology, we created full detection tile datasets. The original) Tj
T*
(pathology images are too large to train on directly, so they were converted into 512 x 512) Tj
T*
(image tiles.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For each scanner group, tiles were generated with both positive and negative examples:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F1 8 Tf
