(Scanner | Train tiles | Train positive | Train negative | Test tiles | Test positive | Test) Tj
T*
(negative) Tj
T*
(Aperio CS2 | 2078 | 1033 | 1045 | 1376 | 688 | 688) Tj
T*
(Hamamatsu S360 | 2287 | 1139 | 1148 | 1164 | 582 | 582) Tj
T*
(Hamammatsu XR | 2549 | 1270 | 1279 | 902 | 451 | 451) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This created a more realistic object detection task because the model must find mitotic) Tj
T*
(figures in image tiles rather than classify pre-cropped candidates.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Full Detection Model) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We trained Faster R-CNN with a ResNet-50 FPN backbone using PyTorch/Torchvision. The task) Tj
T*
(was configured as a two-class detection problem:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(* Background) Tj
T*
(* Mitotic figure) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Two detector settings were compared:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(* Baseline detector: no color jitter augmentation.) Tj
T*
(* Color-jitter detector: training images augmented with color/stain variation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Evaluation used detection matching with IoU threshold 0.3 and multiple confidence score) Tj
T*
(thresholds. For each checkpoint, the best score threshold was selected by F1.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Initial Detection Results and Issue Found) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The first full detection runs showed that final checkpoints were unreliable. Some models had) Tj
T*
(good intermediate checkpoints but collapsed or degraded by the final epoch.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Example:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(* Hamammatsu XR color-jitter final checkpoint had F1 = 0.000.) Tj
T*
(* The same run at checkpoint epoch 3 had F1 = 0.630.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This means the method was not actually failing completely; rather, the last checkpoint was a) Tj
T*
(poor representative of the model. Because of this, checkpoint sweeping was added.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Checkpoint-Sweep Detection Results) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We evaluated every saved checkpoint and selected the best checkpoint per scanner/model.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Held-out scanner | Model | Best checkpoint | Score | Precision | Recall | F1) Tj
T*
(Aperio CS2 | Baseline | epoch 4 | 0.700 | 0.465 | 0.654 | 0.544) Tj
T*
(Aperio CS2 | Color jitter | epoch 5 | 0.700 | 0.604 | 0.727 | 0.660) Tj
T*
(Hamamatsu S360 | Baseline | epoch 4 | 0.700 | 0.650 | 0.650 | 0.650) Tj
T*
